-- הסכם עוז לתמורה (14.8.2011), §37 הקצאה חליפית למענקים בשנת הלימודים
-- תשע"ב: if neither the evaluation model nor §36's reward programme is
-- ready for paying the teachers by 31.8.2012, every teacher of תשע"ב gets a
-- one-time grant of 2,000 for a full position, in proportion to the
-- position and to the part of September to June, maternity leave excepted;
-- no hour value, severance, percentage supplements or training fund,
-- pension contributions of 5% and 5%.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `oz-founding-common`
IMPORT `oz-founding-35`
IMPORT `oz-founding-36`

§ `37 הקצאה חליפית למענקים בשנת הלימודים תשע"ב`

§§ `37(א)`

-- (א): where both the evaluation model and the reward programme of §36 are
-- not ready for paying the teachers by 31.8.2012 (the day included:
-- convention dates.end), then at the end of תשע"ב every teacher employed in
-- תשע"ב is entitled to a one-time grant: 2,000 for a full position; to one
-- employed part-time and/or only in part of the year — save a teacher on
-- maternity leave, for the period of the leave, as §36(ד) words it — the
-- proportional part, the year being "ספטמבר עד יוני", ten months. The
-- model's being ready to pay by 31.8.2012 is read as §35(ו)'s being ready
-- to evaluate the teachers for תשע"ב, whose grants §35(ד) pays by August
-- 2012: one fact, asked once. No clause updates this grant by the CPI.
@ref akn:art_37__para_a
`the section 37 grant for a full position` MEANS 2000

`the months of section 37's year` MEANS 10

GIVEN t IS AN `Oz grant teacher`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the part of the year section 37 counts for` t IS
    (t's `months employed from September to June` PLUS t's `months on maternity leave from September to June`) DIVIDED BY `the months of section 37's year`

GIVEN `the model was ready to evaluate the teachers for 5772` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the programme was ready to pay by 31.8.2012` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `section 37's alternative allocation is made` `the model was ready to evaluate the teachers for 5772` `the programme was ready to pay by 31.8.2012` IF
        NOT `the model was ready to evaluate the teachers for 5772`
    AND NOT `the programme was ready to pay by 31.8.2012`

GIVEN `the model was ready to evaluate the teachers for 5772` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the programme was ready to pay by 31.8.2012` IS A BOOLEAN
      t IS AN `Oz grant teacher` @desc in תשע"ב
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the section 37 grant` `the model was ready to evaluate the teachers for 5772` `the programme was ready to pay by 31.8.2012` t IS
    IF `section 37's alternative allocation is made` `the model was ready to evaluate the teachers for 5772` `the programme was ready to pay by 31.8.2012`
    THEN `an Oz grant pro rata` `the section 37 grant for a full position` (t's `position share`) (`the part of the year section 37 counts for` t)
    ELSE 0

-- F-oz-founding-37-a: when neither is ready, §35(ו) (the model not ready)
-- and §36(ח) (the programme not ready) are met by their own words beside
-- §37, and none of the three says it displaces the others. The heading
-- calls §37 "הקצאה חליפית למענקים בשנת הלימודים תשע"ב". The reading adopted
-- (convention precedence.heading): §37's grant is paid in place of those
-- two, not with them; where only one of them is not ready, that one's
-- grant is paid.
GIVEN `the model was ready to evaluate the teachers for 5772` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the programme was ready to pay by 31.8.2012` IS A BOOLEAN
      t IS AN `Oz grant teacher` @desc in תשע"ב
      `the May indices` IS A LIST OF NUMBER @desc §§35(ה) and 36(ז)'s, for the two grants it updates
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the grants of 5772 when the model or the programme is not ready` `the model was ready to evaluate the teachers for 5772` `the programme was ready to pay by 31.8.2012` t `the May indices` IS
    IF `section 37's alternative allocation is made` `the model was ready to evaluate the teachers for 5772` `the programme was ready to pay by 31.8.2012`
    THEN `the section 37 grant` `the model was ready to evaluate the teachers for 5772` `the programme was ready to pay by 31.8.2012` t
    ELSE `the section 35(ו) grant` `the model was ready to evaluate the teachers for 5772` t `the May indices`
         PLUS `the section 36(ח) grant` `the programme was ready to pay by 31.8.2012` t `the May indices`

§§ `37(ב)–(ג)`

-- (ב): the grant is not in the base of the hour value, of severance pay or
-- of a percentage supplement, and no training fund contribution is made on
-- it. (ג): pension provident fund contributions are made on it, 5% by the
-- employer and 5% deducted from the teacher's salary, for benefits. Neither
-- names the Dafna fund (convention reading.closed-list).
@ref akn:art_37__para_b akn:art_37__para_c
GIVEN p IS A `what an Oz salary component counts for`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the section 37 grant counts for` p IF
    p EQUALS `contributions to a pension provident fund`

`the employer's pension contribution rate on the section 37 grant` MEANS 5%
`the teacher's pension deduction rate on the section 37 grant` MEANS 5%

§§ `37 -- illustrations`

`a teacher on the reform in 5772, all year` MEANS
    `Oz grant teacher` WITH
        `position share`                                   IS 1
        `months employed`                                  IS 12
        `months on maternity leave`                        IS 0
        `months employed from September to June`           IS 10
        `months on maternity leave from September to June` IS 0
        `months on unpaid leave or sabbatical`             IS 0
        `a substitute only`                                IS FALSE
        `on the reform's terms`                            IS `the Oz reform in part`

`a teacher at 60% from September to January, then on maternity leave` MEANS
    `Oz grant teacher` WITH
        `position share`                                   IS 0.6
        `months employed`                                  IS 7
        `months on maternity leave`                        IS 5
        `months employed from September to June`           IS 5
        `months on maternity leave from September to June` IS 5
        `months on unpaid leave or sabbatical`             IS 0
        `a substitute only`                                IS FALSE
        `on the reform's terms`                            IS `off the Oz reform`

`no section 37 update` MEANS EMPTY

#ASSERT `the section 37 grant` FALSE FALSE `a teacher on the reform in 5772, all year` EQUALS 2000
#ASSERT `the section 37 grant` TRUE FALSE `a teacher on the reform in 5772, all year` EQUALS 0
-- 60% of 2,000, her maternity leave counted as employment
#ASSERT `the section 37 grant` FALSE FALSE `a teacher at 60% from September to January, then on maternity leave` EQUALS 1200
-- neither ready: 2,000 in place of 650 and 1,600; only the programme not
-- ready: §36(ח)'s 1,600; only the model: §35(ו)'s 650
#ASSERT `the grants of 5772 when the model or the programme is not ready` FALSE FALSE `a teacher on the reform in 5772, all year` `no section 37 update` EQUALS 2000
#ASSERT `the grants of 5772 when the model or the programme is not ready` TRUE FALSE `a teacher on the reform in 5772, all year` `no section 37 update` EQUALS 1600
#ASSERT `the grants of 5772 when the model or the programme is not ready` FALSE TRUE `a teacher on the reform in 5772, all year` `no section 37 update` EQUALS 650
#ASSERT `the section 37 grant counts for` `contributions to a pension provident fund` AND NOT `the section 37 grant counts for` `computing the hour value`

-- F-oz-founding-37-a's evidence: when neither is ready, §35(ו), §36(ח) and
-- §37 each give the teacher a grant by its own words — 4,250 together —
-- and the reading pays §37's alone.
`sections 35(ו), 36(ח) and 37 all give a grant when neither is ready` MEANS
        `the section 35(ו) grant` FALSE `a teacher on the reform in 5772, all year` `no section 37 update` EQUALS 650
    AND `the section 36(ח) grant` FALSE `a teacher on the reform in 5772, all year` `no section 37 update` EQUALS 1600
    AND `the section 37 grant` FALSE FALSE `a teacher on the reform in 5772, all year` EQUALS 2000
    AND `the grants of 5772 when the model or the programme is not ready` FALSE FALSE `a teacher on the reform in 5772, all year` `no section 37 update` EQUALS 2000
#ASSERT `sections 35(ו), 36(ח) and 37 all give a grant when neither is ready`
